title: 'DynaMusium — Museum of Dynamic Systems'
type: software
authors:
  - name: 'yktsnd'
    alias: yktsnd
repository-code: 'https://github.com/yktsnd/dynamusium'
url: 'https://yktsnd.github.io/dynamusium/'
license: MIT
version: 1.1.0
date-released: '2026-07-28'
abstract: >
  DynaMusium is an in-browser museum of thirty sourced, deterministic
  interactive works spanning dynamical systems across the sciences. Each
  work follows a Dynamical Portrait contract from a numerical kernel through
  provenance-carrying results, evidence-backed analyzers, and reviewed
  semantic visual mappings, so every image can be traced back to a
  reproducible calculation. Observe, Study, and Exhibit modes, together with
  accessible data tables, let visitors move between direct observation and
  underlying evidence with an explicit evidence-qualification scheme.
keywords:
  - dynamical-systems
  - scientific-visualization
  - interactive-simulation
  - numerical-methods
  - science-communication
